  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voices for Change: Empowering Women and Adolescent Girls Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the enabling environment for adolescent girls&#x2019; and women&#x2019;s empowerment in Nigeria by 2017.This will improve the lives of 120000 adolescent girls and women, resulting in greater inclusion of adolescent girls and women issues in political and governance processes and improved use of evidence in policy and practice.</narrative>
  </description>
